  "title": "Budding young scientists in Rowde inspired by National Grid’s latest STEM session",
  "summary": "Using energy sticks that lit up when a circuit was complete, the children carried out a range of experiments to discover which everyday materials allow electricity to flow and which stop it in its tracks. Many of the children were surprised to learn that they could conduct electricity themselves by joining hands to create human circuits that lit up the energy sticks.",
